hadiths[7]{hadithnumber,text}:
"781","(75) Li'an ka bab - Abdullah ibn Hashim ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Yahya - ya'ni al-Qattan - ne hum se bayan kiya, Abd al-Malik ibn Abi Sulayman se, unhon ne kaha: main ne Sa'id ibn Jubayr ko kehte hue suna: Ibn al-Zubayr ki hukumat mein mutala'inain (li'an karne wale miyan-biwi) ke bare mein mujh se pucha gaya ke kya un dono ke darmiyan tafreeq kar di jayegi? To mujhe maloom na tha ke kya kahun, to main apni jagah se uth kar Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma ke ghar ki taraf gaya, to main ne kaha: Abu Abd al-Rahman, mutala'inain ke darmiyan kya tafreeq kar di jayegi? Unhon ne kaha: SubhanAllah, haan. Is bare mein sab se pehle sawal karne wala falan ibn falan tha, us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, us shakhs ke bare mein batayiye jo apni biwi ko fahisha (buri harkat) par dekhe? Agar woh bole to bahut badi baat kahe, aur agar khamosh rahe to isi jaisi (bhari) baat par khamosh rahe! Unhon ne kaha: To aap ne use jawab na diya, unhon ne kaha: phir jab agla din hua to woh aap ke paas aya, to us ne kaha: jis ke bare mein main ne sawal kiya tha main usi mein mubtala kar diya gaya hun, to Allah ne Surah al-Nur mein yeh ayat nazil farmayi: Wa allazina yarmuna azwajahum - hatta ke wahan tak pahuncha - Wa al-khamisata anna ghadab Allahi alaiha in kana min al-sadiqin, to aap ne mard se ibtida ki aur use naseehat ki aur yaad-dihani karayi, aur use khabar di ke duniya ka azab akhirat ke azab se halka hai, to us ne kaha: Qasam us Zaat ki jis ne aap ko haqq ke sath bheja, main ne jhoot nahin bola, phir aap ne aurat se dusri bari mein (muamala kiya) aur use naseehat ki aur yaad-dihani karayi, aur use khabar di ke duniya ka azab akhirat ke azab se halka hai, to us ne kaha: Qasam us Zaat ki jis ne aap ko haqq ke sath bheja, beshak woh jhoota hai, unhon ne kaha: to aap ne mard se ibtida ki, to us ne Allah ki qasam ke sath char gawahiyan di ke beshak woh sachon mein se hai, aur panchwin (mein kaha ke) Allah ki la'nat us par ho agar woh jhooton mein se ho, phir aap ne aurat se dusri bari mein (liya), to us ne Allah ki qasam ke sath char gawahiyan di ke beshak woh jhooton mein se hai, aur panchwin (mein kaha ke) Allah ka ghadab us par ho agar woh sachon mein se ho, phir aap ne un dono ke darmiyan tafreeq farma di."
"782","al-Hasan ibn Muhammad al-Za'farani ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ibn Uyaynah ne hum se bayan kiya, Amr se, Sa'id ibn Jubayr se, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne mutala'inain ke darmiyan tafreeq farma di aur farmaya: tum dono ka hisab Allah par hai, tum mein se ek jhoota hai, tumhare liye is (aurat) par koi rasta (haqq) nahin. Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mera maal? Aap ne farmaya: tumhare liye is (aurat) par koi maal nahin, agar tum is par (ilzam mein) sachche the to woh us ke badle hai jo tum ne is ki sharmgah se halal kiya, aur agar tum ne jhoot bola to woh tumhein is se aur zyada door karega."
"783","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Rahman ibn Mahdi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Malik ibn Anas ne hum se bayan kiya, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar Raziallahu anhuma se ke ek mard ne apni biwi se li'an kiya aur us ke bache se inkar kiya, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne un dono ke darmiyan tafreeq farma di, aur bache ko aurat se milhaq (mansub) farma diya."
"784","al-Rabi' ibn Sulayman ne humein khabar di ke Ibn Wahb ne un se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi al-Zinad ne mujhe khabar di, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: mujh se al-Qasim ibn Muhammad ne hadees bayan ki, Abdullah ibn Abbas se: ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne al-Ajlani aur us ki biwi ke darmiyan li'an karaya, aur woh hamila thi."
"785","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Yusuf ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: al-Awza'i ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mujh se al-Zuhri ne hadees bayan ki, Sahl ibn Sa'd se, ke Uwaymir Asim ibn Adi ke paas aya aur hadees ka kuch hissa zikr kiya, unhon ne kaha: to us ne is (biwi) se li'an kiya, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: agar tum ne use rok kar rakha to tum ne is par zulm kiya. Unhon ne kaha: To us ne use talaq de di, phir woh un dono ke baad ane wale mutala'inain ke liye sunnat (tariqa) ban gaya, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: dekho; agar woh use kala, aankhon ki sakht siyahi wala, surinon ke etebar se bada, pindliyon ke etebar se bhari (mota) lekar ayi, to main Uwaymir ko magar sachcha hi samajhta hun, aur agar woh use surkh rang ka goya ke woh wihara (chhoti chhipkali) hai lekar ayi, to main Uwaymir ko magar jhoota hi samajhta hun. Unhon ne kaha: To woh use us sifat par lekar ayi jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Uwaymir ki tasdeeq mein bayan farmayi thi. Unhon ne kaha: Aur woh (bacha) is ke baad apni maan ki taraf mansub kiya jata tha."
"786","(76) Bab - Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Ubaydullah ibn Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, Israil se, Simak se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se (ha). Unhon ne kaha: Aur Muhammad ibn Yusuf ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Israil ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Simak ibn Harb ne hum se bayan kiya, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhuma se, unhon ne kaha: Ek aurat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke zamane mein Islam layi, phir us ne (dusra) nikah kar liya. To us ka shauhar al-Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, beshak main us ke sath Islam la chuka tha aur woh mere Islam ko janti thi, unhon ne kaha: To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne use us ke dusre shauhar se le liya, aur use us ke pehle shauhar ki taraf lauta diya."
"787","(77) Bab - Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Abu Nu'aym ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abd al-Rahman - ya'ni Ibn Sulayman ibn al-Ghasil - ne hum se bayan kiya, Hamzah ibn Abi Usayd se, Abi Usayd se, unhon ne kaha: Hum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke sath nikle hatta ke hum ek bagh ki taraf chale jise al-Shawt kaha jata hai, hatta ke hum do baghon tak pahunche, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Yahan baitho. Phir aap dakhil hue, aur al-Jawniyyah ko laya gaya tha aur use khajuron wale ghar mein uthara gaya tha: Umaymah bint al-Nu'man ibn Sharahil aur us ke sath us ki parwarish karne wali daya thi, phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) us ke paas dakhil hue to farmaya: Apne aap ko mujhe hiba kar do, us ne kaha: Kya malika apne aap ko aam admi ko hiba karti hai? Unhon ne kaha: To aap ne apna hath jhukaya ke us par apna hath rakhen taake woh sukoon pakde, to us ne kaha: Main tum se Allah ki panah mangti hun, aap ne farmaya: Tum ne panah dene wali hasti ki panah le li hai. Phir aap hamare paas bahar tashreef laye aur farmaya: Ae Abu Usayd, use do raziqiyyah kapde pehna do aur use us ke ghar walon tak pahuncha do."
